{"full":"cloudflare/vibesdk","name":"vibesdk","description":"An open-source vibe coding platform that helps you build your own vibe-coding platform, built entirely on Cloudflare stack ","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":5410,"forks":1279,"created":"2025-08-25T15:07:31Z","updated":"2026-09-22T10:49:08Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://build.cloudflare.dev","topics":["ai","cloudflare-workers","coding-agent","durable-objects","text-to-app","vibe-coding"],"demo":"https://build.cloudflare.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:12.284Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:12.284Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T18:53:12.284Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:29.639Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:17.885Z","stars":5397,"forks":1267},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:29.453Z","stars":5397,"forks":1266},{"at":"2026-10-05T16:57:20.103Z","stars":5395,"forks":1268},{"at":"2026-10-07T18:41:22.813Z","stars":5397,"forks":1271},{"at":"2026-10-09T19:32:18.316Z","stars":5401,"forks":1271},{"at":"2026-10-13T06:36:12.343Z","stars":5402,"forks":1276},{"at":"2026-10-15T18:03:29.443Z","stars":5407,"forks":1276},{"at":"2026-10-17T18:53:12.284Z","stars":5410,"forks":1279}],"technologies":["React"],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T13:42:06.783Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An open source, agentic platform for building and deploying full-stack applications on Cloudflare.","VibeSDK lets people build full-stack applications by working with an AI coding agent. Describe what you want, answer clarifying questions, and follow the agent as it plans, edits files, deploys previews, inspects errors, and iterates with you in the loop.","The platform runs the complete workflow on Cloudflare. Think drives the agentic model-and-tool loop, a Durable Object provides an isolated workspace for each project, Dynamic Workers serve generated application previews, Durable Object Facets provide per-app SQLite storage, and Cloudflare Artifacts stores durable git history and restore points."],"features":["Agentic code generation: Build iteratively through a model-and-tool loop instead of a fixed sequence of generation phases.","Human-in-the-loop clarification: Let the agent ask structured questions when a request is underspecified.","Live workspace: Follow generated files and edits in an integrated code editor.","Dynamic previews: Bundle generated code and load each preview as a Dynamic Worker without a long-running development server.","Browser verification: Inspect browser console output, repair runtime errors, and redeploy in the same loop."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vibesdk/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9a33c40385730e152744cd81619caf694ec6f6ed8d56137836cb157574adcac5","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:16:54.431Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:29.637Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-22T10:49:08Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:46.920Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v1.5.0","tag":"v1.5.0","publishedAt":"2026-02-06T20:22:32Z","url":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vibesdk/releases/tag/v1.5.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:46.920Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/1af11c99445dae6376df7c7f.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-11T11:18:52.725Z","url":"https://build.cloudflare.dev/"}],"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An open source, agentic platform for building and deploying full-stack applications on Cloudflare.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vibesdk/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"A Cloudflare account with the required Workers features enabled.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cloudflare/vibesdk/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Required variables are missing: Verify JWTSECRET, Cloudflare account credentials, AI Gateway settings, and credentials for every enabled provider or in